---
import { STANDARD_MOQ_PCS } from '../data/site';
---
<dl class="pdr-purchase-list">
  <div><dt>Standard MOQ</dt><dd>{STANDARD_MOQ_PCS.toLocaleString('en-US')} pieces. Record the minimum for your configuration in the quotation.</dd></div>
  <div><dt>Samples &amp; timing</dt><dd>Agree sample quantity, charges and preparation time. Record production and delivery dates in the quotation.</dd></div>
  <div><dt>Label &amp; packing</dt><dd>Send artwork and any connection or packing requirements with the model specification.</dd></div>
</dl>
<div class="pdr-resource-actions"><a class="pdr-secondary" href="/oem/">OEM requirements</a><a class="pdr-secondary" href="/factory/packing-and-dispatch/">Packing &amp; dispatch</a><a class="pdr-secondary" href="/resources/motor-capacitor-order-shipment-checklist/">Order checklist</a></div>
